        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on how the Chief Operating Decision Maker (“CODM”) manages the business, allocates resources, makes operating decisions, and evaluates operating performance, the Company manages its business in two operating and reportable segments: Transportation Solutions (“TS”) and Parts & Services (“P&S”).",
        "start_character": 6879,
        "end_character": 7179
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our independent dealer network, we bolster our aftermarket support through a preferred partner network that provides equipment service, maintenance and access to Wabash Genuine Parts.",
        "start_character": 38022,
        "end_character": 38220
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide parts and maintenance and repair services for tank trailers and other related equipment through our five tank service centers.",
        "start_character": 43978,
        "end_character": 44128
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our patents include intellectual property related to the manufacture of trailers, containers, truck bodies, platform trailers, tanks, and other engineered products as well as digital systems and methods for monitoring and securing trailers and trailer components—all of which we believe offer us a significant competitive advantage in the markets in which we compete.",
        "start_character": 53937,
        "end_character": 54304
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our engineered products component of the Parts & Services segment, we sell our products to customers including, but not limited to, Penske Truck Leasing Co., L.P., Transglobal, and Whiting Door Manufacturing, Corp.",
        "start_character": 50122,
        "end_character": 50344
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Throughout our history, we have been and we expect to continue to be a leading innovator in the design and production of transportation products.",
        "start_character": 32537,
        "end_character": 32682
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To that end, we design, manufacture, and service a diverse range of products supporting first-to-final mile operations, including dry freight and refrigerated trailers, platform trailers, tank trailers, dry and refrigerated truck bodies, structural composite panels and products, trailer aerodynamic solutions, and specialty food grade processing equipment.",
        "start_character": 531,
        "end_character": 888
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Utilizing our on-site service centers, we provide a wide array of quality aftermarket parts and services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 43855,
        "end_character": 43977
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer direct-line access to truck body repair parts (generally for all manufacturers) and provide other services such as door repair and replacement, collision repair (generally for all manufacturers), and basic maintenance.",
        "start_character": 44492,
        "end_character": 44724
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also a leading provider of liquid-transportation systems and engineered products and we have a strong customer base, consisting of mostly private fleets, and have earned a leading market position across many of the markets we serve.",
        "start_character": 31649,
        "end_character": 31888
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000879526-26-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000879526-26-000036-19bc0026e4bc4c73",
        "accession_number": "0000879526-26-000036",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe all of these proprietary products offer us a competitive market advantage in the industries in which we compete.",
